  "Description": "Drives NPC dialogue, affect and MetaHuman faces from Unscripted, and carries out the physical acts the runtime asks for. Built from source against whichever engine it is dropped into; declares no EngineVersion, because pinning one makes the plugin manager refuse to load it on every other. Speaks service contract 2.0.0; negotiates with GET /capabilities and refuses to start if the runtime does not list a version it understands.",
